    #1 0x55dd438ff1be in main leak.cpp:2
SUMMARY: AddressSanitizer: 400 byte(s) leaked in 1 allocation(s).
[process exited with status 1]
```
:::

```{.cpp}
#include <iostream>

int main() {
    int* p = new int(7);
    delete p;
    std::cout << *p << '\n';                      // use after delete
}
```

::: {.cell-output .cell-output-stdout}
```
==PID==ERROR: AddressSanitizer: heap-use-after-free on address 0x502000000010 at pc 0x559cce6b530d bp 0x7ffc659e3290 sp 0x7ffc659e3280
READ of size 4 at 0x502000000010 thread T0
